    "The NIRF abbreviation H.D. Joshi matches the official institution identity Haridev Joshi Rajkiya Kanya Mahavidhyalaya Banswara; the official page gives the Banswara address and Rajasthan government email domain.",
    "Initial normal TLS access produced the managed proxy error 'self signed certificate in certificate chain'. After confirming the expected public hosts, curl --insecure was used only for public GET requests; no credentials or private data were sent.",
    "The official homepage lists BA Part I, BCom Part I, BSc Part I Biology, and BSc Part I Maths. The official PG page lists Home Science admission rows under category labels, which were consolidated into the single M.A Home Science programme.",
    "The official introduction page states that the college was promoted to PG status with a new M.Sc Chemistry course from 2022-23, but the visible PG admissions catalogue does not list M.Sc Chemistry. The official catalogue is therefore partial/internally incomplete and requires manual review.",
